title: Political Rally
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: rally_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; rally_timer = 6
card-image: img/procesion.jpg
go-to: main_rally; mf_disrupt if mf_strength > 180 and not mf_banned and not return_to_normalcy

@mf_disrupt

Groups of Falangists have disrupted our rally! Their street troops are preventing us from meeting.

- @police_protect: Call the Guardia de Asalto to protect our rally.
- @js_protect: Use the Juventudes Socialistas to protect our rally.
- @both_protect: The Guardia de Asalto and Juventudes Socialistas should work together to protect our rally.
- @cancel: Cancel the rally.

@police_protect
view-if: psoe_in_government == 1
on-arrival: police_protect_success = guardia_de_asalto_loyalty * guardia_de_asalto_militancy * guardia_de_asalto_strength*2 - mf_militancy*mf_strength;
go-to: police_protect_win if police_protect_success >= 0; police_protect_lose if police_protect_success < 0

@police_protect_win
go-to: main_rally

The Guardia de Asalto successfully protected our rally, so it can go ahead as usual.

@police_protect_lose
on-arrival: strife += 1; workers_nsdap += 3

Unfortunately, the Guardia de Asalto were unable or unwilling to hold back the falangist mob. The fascists have won this show of strength. These fights These fights favor the CEDA, which presents itself as the party of order.

@js_protect
on-arrival: js_success = js_strength*js_militancy - mf_strength*mf_militancy; strife += 1
go-to: js_protect_win if js_success >= 0; js_protect_lose if js_success < 0

@js_protect_win
go-to: main_rally

The Juventudes Socialistas has successfully protected our rally against the falangists! Our meeting can go ahead as usual.

@js_protect_lose
on-arrival: workers_ap += 3; middle_ap += 3; workers_jons +=2; js_strength -= 50

Unfortunately, the Juventudes Socialistas was not able to hold back the falangist mob. The fascists have won this show of strength. These fights These fights favor the CEDA, which presents itself as the party of order.

@both_protect
view-if:  psoe_in_government == 1
choose-if: guardia_de_asalto_training > 0
unavailable-subtitle: The loyal sections of the Guardia de Asalto have never coordinated with the Juventudes Socialistas before.
on-arrival: js_success = js_strength*js_militancy - mf_strength*mf_militancy + guardia_de_asalto_loyalty*guardia_de_asalto_militancy*guardia_de_asalto_strength*2; strife += 1
go-to: both_protect_win if js_success >= 0; both_protect_lose if js_success < 0

@both_protect_win
go-to: main_rally

The Guardia de Asalto and Juventudes Socialistas have successfully protected our rally against the falangists! Our meeting can go ahead as usual.

@both_protect_lose
on-arrival: workers_ap += 3; middle_ap += 3; workers_jons +=2; js_strength -= 50; mf_strength += 10;

Unfortunately, the Guardia de Asalto and Juventudes Socialistas were not able to hold back the falangist mob. The fascists have won this show of strength. These fights These fights favor the CEDA, which presents itself as the party of order.


@cancel
on-arrival: workers_jons += 1;

The falangists have won this show of strength.

@main_rally

Mass rallies are a common feature of social democratic life, especially in the lead-up to an election. What is the primary theme of this rally?

- @class_struggle: The class struggle of the proletariat against the bourgeoisie.
- @welfare: The maintenance and expansion of social welfare programs.
- @democracy: Expanding our nascent democracy and defending it against dictatorship and fascism.
- @wtb: Support the Agrarian Reform!
- @local: A mixture of various local and national concerns that resonate most with the audience.
- @easy_discard

@class_struggle
on-arrival: workers_psoe += 4*(1-dissent); unemployed_psoe += 3*(1-dissent) if caballeristas_strength > prietistas_strength; workers_psoe += 4*(1-dissent) if nationalization_progress > 0; unemployed_psoe += 3*(1-dissent) if nationalization_progress > 0; caballeristas_strength += 5; caballeristas_dissent -= 5; middle_psoe -= 5;

Our message of class struggle appeals to the left wing of the working class, while potentially alienating the middle class. [? if nationalization_progress > 0 : Our achievements in nationalization have assisted our messaging. ?]

@welfare
on-arrival: workers_psoe += 3*(1-dissent); workers_psoe += 3*(1-dissent) if welfare > 0; unemployed_psoe += 3*(1-dissent) if welfare > 0; unemployed_psoe += 4*(1-dissent) if welfare > 1; reformist_strength += 3; besteiristas_strength += 4; besteiristas_dissent -= 3; besteiristas_dissent -= 3;

The reformist message appeals to the organized workers, whose benefits are the accomplishments of social democracy. [? if welfare > 1 : Our achievements in expanding welfare have made this message more effective. ?]

@democracy
on-arrival: democratization += 1; pro_republic += 2*(1 - dissent); workers_psoe += 4*(1-dissent) if democratization >= 3; unemployed_psoe += 3*(1-dissent) if democratization >= 3; pro_republic += 4*(1 - dissent) if democratization >= 3; new_middle_psoe += 4*(1-dissent) if democratization >= 3 

Our speakers defend the republican system and rail against the monarchists and authoritarians who threaten it.

[? if democratization < 3 : Talk of democracy does not excite the workers as much as more practical issues. But that may change; part of our job is to provide political education to the proletariat. ?]
[? if democratization >= 3 : Since we have consistently made democratization a theme of our campaign, the workers are enthusiastic about our message. ?]

@wtb
view-if: wtb_adopted = 1
choose-if: return_to_normalcy = 0
unavailable-subtitle: The economic crisis is largely over now, and the public is no longer interested in hearing about it.
on-arrival: wtb_support += 1; workers_psoe += 3*(1-dissent); unemployed_psoe += 4*(1-dissent); rural_psoe += 6*(1-dissent);

The Agrarian Reform has become a popular rallying cry for our party. The workers are eager to go back to work, and that is exactly what the plan promises.


@local
on-arrival: workers_psoe += 3*(1-dissent); middle_psoe += 3*(1-dissent); unemployed_psoe += 3*(1-dissent);

Our speakers have gauged the mood and are speaking to the issues that seem to most affect the workers in this moment.
